message: "If you use OpenVetAtlas Android in your research, education, or academic work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "OpenVetAtlas Android (oVa): Open-Source 3D Veterinary Anatomy and Osteology Platform for Android"
abstract: "OpenVetAtlas Android (oVa) is an open-source mobile 3D anatomy and osteology platform developed for Android phones and tablets using Godot Engine 4 (GL Compatibility) to support three-dimensional learning in veterinary medical education, utilizing 3D digital twins scanned at DijiLab."
